The pin was verified on 2026-10-28: Part 1 14471540 bytes, 303 pages;
Part 2 6669330 bytes, 89 pages. NTRS distribution PUBLIC,
determinationType PUBLIC_USE_PERMITTED, containsThirdPartyMaterial false.
Part 1 states that NASA SP-20240014019 Version 2 supersedes the Version 1
handbook dated November 2011. The Part 2 verso carries a typo in its own
supersession sentence; that number is not the pin.

